 "description": "118 m² apartment making it one of the largest apartments in South Quay development highly desirable SA1 Waterfront, the property offers contemporary waterfront living in one of the city’s most sought-after locations.\n\nThis well-presented apartment features a spacious open-plan living and dining area. The property is south facing to maximise natural light alongside the sea views and provides a comfortable yet stylish living environment. The modern kitchen is fitted with integrated appliances and ample storage, making it ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. Access to two private balconies which further enhances the space, offering an attractive outlook and an ideal setting to relax.\n\nThe property comprises two generously sized bedrooms, one bedroom includes en-suite bathroom, alongside a separate main bathroom. Additional benefits include secure entry, lift access and allocated secure garage parking.\n\nPerfectly positioned within walking distance of Swansea Marina, the city centre, beach, restaurants and leisure amenities, the apartment is ideally suited to professionals, investors, first-time buyers or those seeking a well-located coastal residence. Excellent transport links and easy access to Swansea University and the M4 corridor further add to the property’s appeal.\n\nA superb opportunity to acquire an apartment in the heart of Swansea’s vibrant waterfront community.\n\n \n\n EPC rating: C. Tenure: Leasehold,",
